    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your ammunition beguiles the target. The creature you hit takes extra Psychic damage equal to two rolls of your Arcane Shot Die and must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the Charmed condition until the start of your next turn, with you or one of your allies within 30 feet of it (your choice) as the charmer. The condition ends early if the charmer attacks the target, damages it, or forces it to make a saving throw.</p>",
